Restore from OpenWRT Firmware to Official Firmware
Download the original image for TL-WR840N v5. Image is added in the Firmwares folder.
Rename the image to originalfw.bin.
SSH into the router and copy the original firmware. ssh root@192.168.1.1 "cat > /tmp/originalfw.bin" < /path/to/firmware/originalfw.bin
Rebuild the image without the boot partition. dd if=originalfw.bin of=originalfw_stripped.bin skip=257 bs=512
Flash the stripped image using sysupgrade. sysupgrade originalfw_stripped.bin
Wait for the router to finish the flashing process. Indicated by the blinking LEDs.
Restoration should be completed and the router will be reset to its default IP address, Wireless SSID and Passwords.
